    "title": "City council sees one way forward for Garden Street - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jane Petersen ,\n12 hours ago After contentious comment and discussion, Cambridge City Council on Monday voted 5-4 in favor of keeping Garden Street a one-way road with bike lanes on either side for the majority of its length. The vote reversed last year’s 5-4 vote to return two-way traffic to the West Cambridge street while making the bike lanes adjacent, a move that would eliminate street parking. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
